{"title":"Career roadmap · Web Analyst","role":"Web Analyst","summary":"A Web Analyst studies website and digital-product data to understand how users arrive, navigate, engage, convert and return.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Web Analyst studies website and digital-product data to understand how users arrive, navigate, engage, convert and return."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Web analytics"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Tracking implementation"},{"text":"Customer behaviour analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA graduate, the technical background is especially useful because modern web analytics increasingly involves tracking systems, JavaScript, APIs, SQL, data pipelines and analytics engineering."},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Web Analytics","Digital Marketing","GA4/Tag Management","SQL","JavaScript","Data Visualisation","CRO","Experimentation"],"sep":"+","label":"Best-fit combination"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG Year 1"},{"text":"Web + programming + marketing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"UG Year 2"},{"text":"Analytics + tracking + SQL"}],[{"text":"UG Year 3"},{"text":"CRO + experimentation + dashboards"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Analytics projects + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Web Analyst / Digital Analytics Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Digital Analyst / Product Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Web/Digital Analyst"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Analytics Lead / Digital Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Head of Digital Analytics / Growth Analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the BCA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Web + marketing foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"A Web Analyst should understand both how websites work and why businesses use them."},{"type":"h","text":"Web fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"URLs"},{"text":"Cookies"},{"text":"Sessions"},{"text":"DOM"},{"text":"Browser developer tools"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"JSON"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic JavaScript"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Objects"},{"text":"Arrays"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"DOM manipulation"},{"text":"fetch()"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Basic asynchronous programming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a full-stack JavaScript developer, but you should understand how tracking code and web applications work."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Digital marketing fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"SEO"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Keywords"},{"text":"On-page SEO"},{"text":"Technical SEO"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Search Console concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Paid marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search advertising"},{"text":"Display advertising"},{"text":"Social advertising"},{"text":"Campaign structure"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Content funnels"},{"text":"CTAs"},{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Email marketing basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Web analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes the core of the career."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn analytics concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Users"},{"text":"Sessions"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Page views"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Conversions"},{"text":"Funnels"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Cohorts"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Traffic sources"},{"text":"Campaign tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"Don't simply memorise metrics."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"What business question does each metric answer?"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"Traffic increased but sales decreased."},{"type":"p","text":"A good analyst should investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Traffic quality"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Device mix"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Acquisition channel"},{"text":"Checkout behaviour"},{"text":"Product availability"},{"text":"Technical problems"}]}]},{"heading":"GA4 and analytics platforms","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with a modern web analytics platform such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics 4"},{"text":"Adobe Analytics, where relevant"},{"text":"Other product/web analytics platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event-based measurement"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Metrics"},{"text":"Custom events"},{"text":"Conversions/key events"},{"text":"Audiences"},{"text":"Explorations"},{"text":"Funnels"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Campaign tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For any certification or platform-specific implementation, verify the current interface and terminology because analytics products change frequently."}]},{"heading":"Tracking implementation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where a BCA graduate can differentiate from a purely marketing candidate."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Tag management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tags"},{"text":"Triggers"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Data layers"},{"text":"Event tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn a tag-management platform such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Google Tag Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A user clicks:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Add to Cart\""},{"type":"p","text":"The website can send an event containing information such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"event: add_to_cart"},{"type":"p","text":"product_id"},{"type":"p","text":"product_name"},{"type":"p","text":"category"},{"type":"p","text":"price"},{"type":"p","text":"quantity"},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst can then study:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product view","Add to cart","Checkout","Purchase"]}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL is one of the highest-value technical skills for a Web Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"HAVING"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"CTE"},{"type":"p","text":"SUBQUERY"},{"type":"p","text":"WINDOW FUNCTIONS"},{"type":"h","text":"Example analytical questions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Which channels generated the most revenue?"},{"text":"Which landing pages have the highest conversion rate?"},{"text":"What percentage of users abandon checkout?"},{"text":"Which customer segment has the highest repeat-purchase rate?"},{"text":"What is revenue by acquisition source?"},{"text":"What is the 30-day retention rate?"}]}]},{"heading":"Data analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"SUMIFS/COUNTIFS"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Basic dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Use it for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory analysis"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]}]},{"heading":"Data visualisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn at least one professional BI tool."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Tableau"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Traffic"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Funnel performance"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Campaign performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard principle"},{"type":"p","text":"Don't create:"},{"type":"p","text":"30 charts on one screen."},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business question","KPI","diagnosis","recommended action"]}]},{"heading":"E-commerce analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the specialisation is Digital Marketing / E-Commerce, learn the complete e-commerce funnel."},{"type":"flow","items":["Acquisition","Landing page","Product discovery","Product view","Add to cart","Checkout","Purchase","Repeat purchase"]},{"type":"h","text":"Important metrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Acquisition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Clicks"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CAC"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engagement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement rate"},{"text":"Product views"},{"text":"Time/engagement indicators"},{"text":"Return visits"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Conversion"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Add-to-cart rate"},{"text":"Checkout rate"},{"text":"Purchase rate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Revenue"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Average order value"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retention"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Repeat purchase rate"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"}]}]},{"heading":"Conversion Rate Optimisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Web Analyst should understand CRO."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Landing-page analysis"},{"text":"User behaviour"},{"text":"Heatmaps"},{"text":"Session recordings"},{"text":"Form analysis"},{"text":"Checkout analysis"},{"text":"A/B testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Suppose:"},{"type":"h","text":"100,000 users visit a website"},{"type":"p","text":"but only:"},{"type":"p","text":"1,500 purchase."},{"type":"p","text":"Conversion rate:"},{"type":"h","text":"1.5%"},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst should determine where users drop out rather than simply reporting the 1.5%."}]},{"heading":"Experimentation and A/B testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hypothesis formulation"},{"text":"Control vs treatment"},{"text":"Randomisation"},{"text":"Sample size concepts"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Practical significance"},{"text":"Experiment duration"},{"text":"Guardrail metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"h","text":"Hypothesis:"},{"type":"p","text":"Simplifying the checkout form will increase completed purchases."},{"type":"p","text":"Then:"},{"type":"h","text":"Control → Existing checkout"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment → Simplified checkout"},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Checkout completion"},{"text":"Purchase conversion"},{"text":"Revenue per visitor"},{"text":"Refund/cancellation effects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid declaring a winner merely because one version has a slightly higher conversion rate."}]},{"heading":"Attribution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First-touch attribution"},{"text":"Last-touch attribution"},{"text":"Multi-touch concepts"},{"text":"Data-driven attribution concepts"},{"text":"Direct traffic"},{"text":"Organic search"},{"text":"Paid search"},{"text":"Social"},{"text":"Referral"},{"text":"Email"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important principle:"},{"type":"p","text":"Attribution is a measurement model, not necessarily a perfect representation of causality."},{"type":"p","text":"A Web Analyst should avoid claiming that a channel \"caused\" a sale solely because an attribution model assigned it credit."}]},{"heading":"Product analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Web analytics increasingly overlaps with product analytics."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Feature adoption"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful concepts:"},{"type":"h","text":"AARRR framework"},{"type":"flow","items":["Acquisition","Activation","Retention","Revenue","Referral"]},{"type":"p","text":"This provides a useful framework for analysing digital products."}]},{"heading":"Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build 4–6 serious analytics projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-commerce funnel analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Landing","Product","Cart","Checkout","Purchase"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biggest drop-off"},{"text":"Conversion rates"},{"text":"Device differences"},{"text":"Channel differences"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Deliver:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL analysis"},{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Marketing campaign analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse campaign data by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Channel"},{"text":"Campaign"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Device"},{"text":"Customer segment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Customer cohort analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monthly cohorts"},{"text":"Retention curves"},{"text":"Repeat purchase analysis"},{"text":"Revenue per cohort"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates stronger analytical ability than a simple traffic dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — A/B testing project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated or authorised experiment."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Control"},{"text":"Treatment"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Statistical uncertainty"},{"text":"Business impact"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the hypothesis and methodology."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Web analytics dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI/Tableau dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Users"},{"text":"Sessions"},{"text":"Traffic sources"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Conversions"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Funnel"},{"text":"Campaign performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Technical tracking project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a demo website and implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Page-view tracking"},{"text":"Button events"},{"text":"Form events"},{"text":"Product events"},{"text":"Add-to-cart"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Purchase"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then validate the tracking implementation."},{"type":"p","text":"This project is particularly useful because it combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","web development","analytics."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year capstone"},{"type":"h","text":"E-Commerce Growth Analytics Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Website","Tracking","Analytics data","SQL","Data warehouse","Dashboard","Funnel analysis","Experimentation","Business recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Marketing attribution"},{"text":"Conversion analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A stronger version can add a simple predictive model for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer churn"},{"text":"Purchase probability"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"}]}]},{"heading":"Data warehouse concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a modern analytics career, understand basic analytics engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ETL"},{"text":"ELT"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Fact tables"},{"text":"Dimension tables"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Data pipelines"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud/data warehouse platforms can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BigQuery"},{"text":"Snowflake"},{"text":"Amazon Redshift"},{"text":"Microsoft Fabric"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You don't need to master all of them."},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one environment for practical experience."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Digital Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"text":"E-commerce Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Product Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Growth Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Good industries"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Digital agencies"},{"text":"Consumer apps"},{"text":"D2C brands"}]},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internship work"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to work on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tracking","SQL","Dashboard","Analysis","Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"rather than only:"},{"type":"h","text":"Social media posting → content scheduling"}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Tag management"},{"text":"Digital analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Search advertising"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BigQuery/data warehousing"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Experimentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are useful for structured learning, but portfolio + internship + analytical ability should remain the priority."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Web Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"E-commerce Analyst"},{"text":"Web Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Growth Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Analytics Specialist"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Growth Analyst"},{"text":"E-commerce Analytics Manager"},{"text":"Conversion Rate Optimisation Specialist"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Digital Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Lead"},{"text":"Digital Analytics Manager"},{"text":"Growth Analytics Manager"},{"text":"Head of Digital Analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"What recruiters may test","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Users vs sessions"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Bounce/engagement concepts"},{"text":"Funnels"},{"text":"Cohorts"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Attribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Customer cohorts"},{"text":"Ranking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Know:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"CPA/CAC"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"LTV"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"If:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ad spend = ₹1,00,000"},{"type":"p","text":"and attributed revenue is:"},{"type":"h","text":"₹4,00,000"},{"type":"p","text":"then:"},{"type":"h","text":"ROAS = 4×"},{"type":"p","text":"But the analyst should also investigate whether the attributed revenue is actually incremental and whether costs such as discounts, fulfilment and returns change the economics."}]},{"heading":"Scenario interviews","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Website traffic increased 40%, but revenue remained unchanged. What would you investigate?"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Traffic source"},{"text":"Traffic quality"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Product views"},{"text":"Add-to-cart"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Device/browser"},{"text":"Product availability"},{"text":"Pricing/promotions"},{"text":"Tracking changes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Mobile conversion is much lower than desktop."},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Page speed"},{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Form usability"},{"text":"Payment flow"},{"text":"Browser compatibility"},{"text":"Mobile traffic source"},{"text":"Tracking implementation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario 3"},{"type":"p","text":"A marketing campaign has a high CTR but poor sales."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible explanation:"},{"type":"p","text":"High clicks do not necessarily mean high-quality traffic."},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landing-page relevance"},{"text":"Audience targeting"},{"text":"Intent"},{"text":"Product fit"},{"text":"Conversion funnel"},{"text":"Ad promise vs landing-page experience"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's is not mandatory for Web Analytics."},{"type":"p","text":"Strong professional experience can be more valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful options"},{"type":"h","text":"MCA"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Systems"},{"text":"Analytics technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"ML"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Quantitative analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing strategy"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best choice"},{"type":"p","text":"For a technical analytics career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Web/Digital Analytics","SQL + BI + experimentation","experience"]},{"type":"p","text":"For management:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Analytics experience","MBA Marketing/Business Analytics"]}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's fields include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Digital Marketing"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Product Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technically strong Web Analyst, Business Analytics/Data Analytics can provide a broader long-term path than pursuing only a generic digital-marketing degree."}]},{"heading":"Career specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After 2–4 years, choose a direction."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Website","marketing","attribution","conversion"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["User behaviour","product metrics","experimentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"E-commerce Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customers","conversion","revenue","retention"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Growth Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Acquisition","activation","retention","revenue"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Campaigns","attribution","customer economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Engineering"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","data modelling","pipelines","warehouses"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This last route is particularly attractive for someone with a BCA because it combines software + data + analytics."}]},{"heading":"AI + Web Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated insight generation"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Predictive conversion"},{"text":"Churn prediction"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"Campaign optimisation"},{"text":"Natural-language analytics"},{"text":"Automated dashboard explanations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready Web Analyst should therefore understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Analytics","experimentation","AI","data engineering"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than relying entirely on dashboard creation."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 career evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Traditional Web Analyst:"},{"type":"p","text":"Reports what happened."},{"type":"p","text":"Modern Digital/Product Analyst:"},{"type":"p","text":"Explains why it happened and what should change."},{"type":"p","text":"Future growth analyst:"},{"type":"p","text":"Uses experimentation, predictive models and AI to recommend and evaluate actions."},{"type":"p","text":"The progression becomes:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporting","Diagnosis","Prediction","Experimentation","Decision Intelligence"]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 1 — Core"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Web analytics"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 2 — Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Google Tag Manager"},{"text":"Analytics implementation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 3 — Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GA4"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Retention analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 4 — Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 5 — Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"BigQuery/Snowflake"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Analytics engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tier 6 — AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Recommendation systems"},{"text":"Customer propensity models"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Automated insight generation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal portfolio by graduation"},{"type":"table","header":["Project","Demonstrates"],"rows":[[{"text":"E-commerce funnel analysis"},{"text":"Conversion analytics"}],[{"text":"Marketing campaign analysis"},{"text":"Digital marketing"}],[{"text":"Cohort/retention analysis"},{"text":"Customer analytics"}],[{"text":"A/B testing project"},{"text":"Experimentation"}],[{"text":"Power BI dashboard"},{"text":"Visualisation"}],[{"text":"Tracking implementation"},{"text":"Technical analytics"}],[{"text":"SQL analytics project"},{"text":"Data skills"}]]}]},{"heading":"Target progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Web + Marketing Fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Analytics + GA4 + SQL"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"CRO + BI + Experimentation"}],[{"text":"Final year"},{"text":"Portfolio + Internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Web/Digital Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Digital/Product/Growth Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Analyst"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Analytics Lead / Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Head of Digital/Growth Analytics"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For BCA – Digital Marketing / E-Commerce → Web Analyst, the student should avoid becoming only a dashboard/reporting specialist."},{"type":"p","text":"Build this progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Web + Digital Marketing Fundamentals","GA4 + Tracking + Tag Management","SQL + Excel","Power BI/Tableau","Funnel + Cohort + Attribution Analysis","CRO + A/B Testing","Python + Data Warehousing","Product/Growth Analytics + AI"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest entry-level profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Web analytics","SQL","tracking implementation","digital marketing","dashboards","experimentation","real e-commerce projects."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"That gives the graduate a progression from Web Analyst → Digital/Product Analyst → Growth/E-commerce Analyst → Analytics Lead, while also keeping the door open to more technical careers in Data Analytics and Analytics Engineering."}]}]}